---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms — Kindling" description="Kindling's Phase 0 terms notice.">
  <article class="legal section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Draft for validation</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="legal-notice">Last updated August 10, 2026. This validation-stage stub is not a substitute for the professionally reviewed terms required before release.</p>

    <h2>Prototype use</h2>
    <p>The Kindling website and prototype are provided for product research and evaluation. Features may change, stop working, or be removed while the product is being validated.</p>

    <h2>No medical service</h2>
    <p>Kindling is not medical care, therapy, diagnosis, or crisis support. Do not rely on it for medical decisions or emergencies.</p>

    <h2>Your content</h2>
    <p>You remain responsible for words you enter. During Phase 0, task and first-step text stay in the current browser tab and are not transmitted as research analytics.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not attempt to disrupt the site, access other people's information, or use the prototype unlawfully. The site is offered as available, without a promise that it will meet every need.</p>

    <h2>Before launch</h2>
    <p>Governing law, limitation of liability, contact details, age requirements, and provider disclosures will be finalized with legal review before public app distribution.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
